   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Supply and vulnerability",
     "texto": [
      "A **forsyningskjede** (supply chain) describes the stages that take a product from raw material to the consumer. If one stage fails, the whole chain can be exposed to disruptions.",
      "**Food security** means people have stable access to enough safe food."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Consequences and measures",
     "texto": [
      "**Climate adaptation** reduces the damage caused by climate change, while **emissions reduction** limits its causes. A **circular economy** seeks to keep materials in use for longer."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
